"Apply" = "应用";
"The File Provider domain identifier is invalid." = "文件提供程序同步域标识无效。";
"This Cloudreve location overlaps an existing location." = "此 Cloudreve 位置与现有位置重叠。";
"The File Provider domain could not be found." = "找不到文件提供程序同步域。";
"Local changes must be preserved before this domain can be removed." = "请先保留本地更改，再移除此同步域。";
"The File Provider service could not complete this request." = "文件提供程序服务无法完成此请求。";
"NimbusSync's File Provider extension is unavailable. Quit and reopen NimbusSync, then try again." = "NimbusSync 的文件提供程序扩展不可用。请退出并重新打开 NimbusSync 后重试。";
"macOS disabled the File Provider extension because NimbusSync is running from a translocated location. Move NimbusSync to Applications and reopen it." = "NimbusSync 正在从隔离位置运行，macOS 因此停用了文件提供程序扩展。请将 NimbusSync 移到“应用程序”后重新打开。";
"An older NimbusSync File Provider extension is still running. Quit and reopen NimbusSync, then try again." = "旧版 NimbusSync 文件提供程序扩展仍在运行。请退出并重新打开 NimbusSync 后重试。";
"A newer NimbusSync File Provider extension is already installed. Update NimbusSync and try again." = "已安装更新版本的 NimbusSync 文件提供程序扩展。请更新 NimbusSync 后重试。";
"This File Provider domain is disabled in System Settings. Enable NimbusSync under File Providers, then try again." = "此文件提供程序同步域已在系统设置中停用。请在“文件提供程序”中开启 NimbusSync 后重试。";
"The File Provider service is temporarily unavailable. Try again in a moment." = "文件提供程序服务暂不可用。请稍后重试。";
"NimbusSync's File Provider extension is missing from the app bundle. Reinstall NimbusSync and try again." = "应用包中缺少 NimbusSync 文件提供程序扩展。请重新安装 NimbusSync 后重试。";
"The File Provider document storage is not writable. Check the app's permissions and try again." = "文件提供程序的文稿存储位置不可写。请检查应用权限后重试。";
"A previous NimbusSync Finder location is still registered on this Mac. Remove the old location in System Settings > General > Login Items & Extensions > File Providers, then try again." = "此 Mac 上仍注册着旧的 NimbusSync Finder 位置。请在“系统设置 > 通用 > 登录项与扩展 > 文件提供程序”中移除旧位置后重试。";
"The File Provider service rejected this request. Check System Settings > General > Login Items & Extensions > File Providers, then try again." = "文件提供程序服务拒绝了此请求。请检查“系统设置 > 通用 > 登录项与扩展 > 文件提供程序”后重试。";
"This Cloudreve location overlaps an existing NimbusSync location." = "此 Cloudreve 位置与现有 NimbusSync 位置重叠。";
"The authorized Cloudreve account does not match the selected location." = "已授权的 Cloudreve 账号与所选位置不匹配。";
"The selected Cloudreve root is no longer available." = "所选 Cloudreve 根目录已不可用。";
"Choose a non-empty domain name without control characters." = "请输入不含控制字符的非空同步域名称。";
"A Finder location with this name already exists. Choose a different name, or remove the old NimbusSync location in System Settings." = "已存在同名 Finder 位置。请选择其他名称，或在系统设置中移除旧的 NimbusSync 位置。";
"Another domain already uses this name. Choose a different name." = "其他同步域已使用此名称。请选择其他名称。";
"This domain can't be renamed while it is being removed or repaired." = "此同步域正在移除或修复，暂时无法重命名。";
"NimbusSync could not complete the File Provider operation." = "NimbusSync 无法完成文件提供程序操作。";
"NimbusSync could not add this Cloudreve location to Finder. Check that NimbusSync is enabled under System Settings > General > Login Items & Extensions > File Providers, then try again." = "NimbusSync 无法将此 Cloudreve 位置添加到 Finder。请确认已在“系统设置 > 通用 > 登录项与扩展 > 文件提供程序”中开启 NimbusSync，然后重试。";
